Description: 4k Intro by Ye Olde Laptops Posse & s.k.o.y.p, released in 2017
 4k Intro by Ye Olde Laptops Posse & s.k.o.y.p, ranked 9th in the
 PC 4k compo at Revision 2017.
 .
 Code, shaders and sync by w23 (provod), music by keen (4klang
 synthesizer), additional code by keen and r5ha.
 .
 The 4klang synthesizer is written in 32-bit x86 assembly, so the
 intro is only built for i386.
